  choices = $EXPL$["The subsidiary''s total assets reported on its individual balance sheet","The subsidiary''s common stock and retained earnings, which represent stockholders'' equity","The subsidiary''s revenue and expense accounts for the current reporting period","The parent''s own retained earnings balance on its separate financial statements"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under ASC 810-10-45-1, the basic consolidation elimination entry debits the subsidiary''s equity accounts (common stock and retained earnings) and credits the parent''s investment account. This prevents double-counting because without elimination, both the investment asset and the underlying net assets would appear on the consolidated balance sheet.
